Package: condLogReg
Type: Package
Title: Conditional Logistic Regression
Version: 0.1.1
Date: 2026-10-06
Authors@R: c(person("Ravi", "Selker", role=c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Jonathon", "Love", role=c("aut", "cph"), email="jon@thon.cc"),
    person("Damian", "Dropmann", role=c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Victor", "Moreno", role=c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email="v.moreno@iconcologia.net"))
Maintainer: Victor Moreno <v.moreno@iconcologia.net>
Description: Conditional logistic regression for matched case-control
    studies (and other stratified binary data), cloned from jmv's Binomial
    Logistic Regression. A matching variable defines the matched sets and
    the model is fitted by the conditional likelihood, as a Cox model
    stratified by matched set (survival::coxph, exact method by default,
    the same fit as survival::clogit). Keeps the model builder with blocks,
    reference levels, fit measures, model comparisons, omnibus likelihood
    ratio tests, coefficients and odds ratios with confidence intervals and
    collinearity statistics, and adds a summary of the matched sets.
